WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.300
Safex

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:12.076
Candy realized that it's not easy
to take care of the patients.

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:19.943
The headmistress Merry Jane
who is strong and cordial...

00:00:20.093 --> 00:00:22.954
...that is a real nurse.

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:33.960
The smiling nurse.

00:00:46.146 --> 00:00:48.171
We'll stop here today.

00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:53.284
Observe the rule
while you are practicing.

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:54.713
Yes!

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:57.718
What's wrong with you? Louder!

00:00:58.058 --> 00:00:59.184
Yes!

00:01:09.169 --> 00:01:11.330
Distribute the tasks, Franny.

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:15.062
You take charge of the special ward,
starting from today.

00:01:15.212 --> 00:01:19.407
That's great, Franny, to look after
the patient from the special ward.

00:01:20.046 --> 00:01:22.069
She's the top student.

00:01:22.219 --> 00:01:24.207
We can't compare with her.

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:26.916
Quiet!

00:01:28.955 --> 00:01:30.746
Miss Shany, I have a question.

00:01:30.896 --> 00:01:32.148
What is it, Franny?

00:01:32.298 --> 00:01:35.955
What about the patients
I'm taking care of?

00:01:36.563 --> 00:01:39.225
Leave them to Candy!

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:41.756
Leave them to me?

00:01:43.203 --> 00:01:44.893
Candy is a fresh student.

00:01:45.043 --> 00:01:47.460
It's hard for her to handle that.

00:01:47.610 --> 00:01:51.374
Franny, don't worry. I will do my best.

00:01:53.313 --> 00:01:55.273
Candy can't make it alone.

00:01:55.423 --> 00:01:59.007
And...
it's you who helped her all this time.

00:01:59.157 --> 00:02:00.309
No problem.

00:02:00.459 --> 00:02:03.753
I'll do as what Franny taught me.

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:10.688
Candy,
do your best while you're practicing.

00:02:10.897 --> 00:02:12.660
Yes, I will.

00:02:23.109 --> 00:02:24.502
All by myself.

00:02:24.652 --> 00:02:27.478
Sounds like that I'm a nurse already!

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:33.205
Peacock!

00:02:33.355 --> 00:02:34.786
Really!

00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:38.480
As a new student, if she can
take care of those patients,

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:41.182
how embarrassed Franny will be?

00:02:41.332 --> 00:02:43.922
Better than the top student Franny.

00:02:47.734 --> 00:02:49.599
Franny looked depressed.

00:02:50.637 --> 00:02:53.629
I wouldn't like to be defeated
by a new student either.

00:02:58.678 --> 00:03:00.003
I'm here to take your temperature.

00:03:00.153 --> 00:03:01.740
Hello, dim-wit!

00:03:02.782 --> 00:03:05.142
My name is not dim-wit.

00:03:05.292 --> 00:03:07.651
I am Candice White Adley.

00:03:08.688 --> 00:03:11.919
I shouldn't have said the word Adley.

00:03:12.158 --> 00:03:14.649
It's unfair to Grandfather William.

00:03:16.296 --> 00:03:19.163
What's the matter,
Candice White Adley?

00:03:19.499 --> 00:03:23.868
No, I was wrong.
My name is Candice White.

00:03:24.103 --> 00:03:28.039
You can't even say your name correctly.
What a dim-wit!

00:03:29.676 --> 00:03:32.469
Please call me Candy from now on.

00:03:32.619 --> 00:03:35.377
But, the dim-wit is more fun.

00:03:37.517 --> 00:03:40.486
It's headmistress's fault.

00:03:41.688 --> 00:03:45.454
Dim-wit, why are you standing there?

00:03:46.426 --> 00:03:50.051
They are making fun of me,
I don't want to look at them.

00:03:50.201 --> 00:03:54.963
Don't be depressed,
there's nothing wrong as a dim-wit.

00:03:55.134 --> 00:03:59.125
Anthony, Stear and Archie,
they told me that before.

00:03:59.275 --> 00:04:01.930
I look better when I'm smiling.

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:04.908
Yes, just like that!

00:04:05.345 --> 00:04:08.314
Keep your face smiling, dim-wit!

00:04:09.949 --> 00:04:14.778
They keep calling me dim-wit,
why don't I accept that?

00:04:14.928 --> 00:04:17.697
Alright! You can call me dim-wit.

00:04:17.847 --> 00:04:20.816
But you must cooperate with me
from now on.

00:04:21.027 --> 00:04:22.392
Sure!

00:04:22.962 --> 00:04:25.294
It's a deal, dim-wit.

00:04:25.965 --> 00:04:28.525
Let's take your temperature now.

00:04:32.839 --> 00:04:35.137
Open your mouths, guys!

00:04:35.341 --> 00:04:36.831
It's open.

00:04:38.044 --> 00:04:39.306
Thank you!

00:04:42.448 --> 00:04:43.745
Please!

00:05:02.068 --> 00:05:03.626
Finished.

00:05:04.604 --> 00:05:07.664
Everyone!
Thank you for your cooperation.

00:05:08.107 --> 00:05:10.632
Haven't you forgot anything, dim-wit?

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:17.136
It's all done. Have a nice day, guys.

00:05:17.286 --> 00:05:19.150
Good bye.

00:05:19.819 --> 00:05:21.548
Do your best, Candy!

00:05:23.923 --> 00:05:25.254
Candy?

00:05:32.699 --> 00:05:35.190
They called me Candy.

00:05:36.235 --> 00:05:37.566
Dim-wit!

00:05:39.439 --> 00:05:43.273
Did Pony teach you
to walk like this in the corridors?

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:44.798
No!

00:05:44.948 --> 00:05:48.587
It's the corridor,
don't you know that, dim-wit?

00:05:48.737 --> 00:05:49.641
I am sorry!

00:05:49.791 --> 00:05:53.014
Behave yourself, dim-wit!

00:05:53.319 --> 00:05:54.877
Yes!

00:05:56.255 --> 00:05:57.222
All of you...

00:05:57.457 --> 00:06:00.426
Seems like you're healthy enough
to leave the hospital!

00:06:04.530 --> 00:06:08.454
Dim-wit! Get back to work!

00:06:08.604 --> 00:06:10.035
Yes!

00:06:13.139 --> 00:06:17.235
The patients are more optimistic
since she came here.

00:06:21.881 --> 00:06:25.208
Will you please help me?

00:06:25.358 --> 00:06:26.808
Yes!

00:06:27.353 --> 00:06:30.214
The pillow is uncomfortable.

00:06:30.364 --> 00:06:32.518
I'll handle it.

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:36.784
It's okay now, please!

00:06:36.934 --> 00:06:39.188
Thank you!

00:06:39.338 --> 00:06:41.056
- Excuse me.
- Yes!

00:06:41.206 --> 00:06:43.829
The bandage has been loose,
will you help me?

00:06:44.504 --> 00:06:47.632
Gosh! I am not ready for that.

00:06:48.474 --> 00:06:51.341
- Will you please?
- Okay.

00:06:55.381 --> 00:06:58.248
Am I doing the right thing?

00:06:59.018 --> 00:07:02.244
The patients are emotionally unstable.

00:07:02.394 --> 00:07:04.380
Don't make them panic.

00:07:04.724 --> 00:07:07.016
I should not make her panic...

00:07:07.166 --> 00:07:09.553
or she will not trust me afterwards.

00:07:09.703 --> 00:07:11.755
Just a moment.

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:15.165
It's...

00:07:20.807 --> 00:07:22.570
I am sorry!

00:07:23.609 --> 00:07:25.975
Everyone makes mistakes.

00:07:28.147 --> 00:07:30.339
No one is born doing things right.

00:07:30.489 --> 00:07:34.181
It's nothing if you make a mistake,
you can make it right next time.

00:07:35.521 --> 00:07:37.716
I am sorry.

00:07:38.658 --> 00:07:41.051
Always keep smiling.

00:07:41.201 --> 00:07:46.393
The patients will recover quicker
because of your smile.

00:07:46.632 --> 00:07:47.826
Yes!

00:08:02.648 --> 00:08:06.744
The patients will recover quicker
because of my smile?

00:08:07.587 --> 00:08:10.454
They are so kind to me !

00:08:19.899 --> 00:08:22.231
- Candy!
- Franny!

00:08:23.302 --> 00:08:26.032
Is it hard work?

00:08:26.372 --> 00:08:30.775
Not at all! Patients are
willing to cooperate with me.

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:32.370
I see!

00:08:35.982 --> 00:08:38.274
- Candy!
- What's the matter?

00:08:38.424 --> 00:08:41.250
Don't please the patients on purpose.

00:08:43.389 --> 00:08:47.052
Our patients are talking about
the things you did.

00:08:47.894 --> 00:08:49.486
Things I did?

00:08:50.129 --> 00:08:52.720
They wish to be taken care by you.

00:08:52.870 --> 00:08:56.199
Candy!
Can you look after all the patients?

00:08:56.936 --> 00:08:59.598
But... I...

00:09:00.406 --> 00:09:04.001
Candy, as your roommate,
here is my advice.

00:09:04.443 --> 00:09:09.779
A good nurse would never
please the patients on purpose.

00:09:11.317 --> 00:09:12.579
Yes!

00:09:25.831 --> 00:09:28.026
Who's crying?

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:45.715
Franny?

00:09:54.694 --> 00:09:56.161
Franny.

00:09:59.498 --> 00:10:01.466
What happened, Franny?

00:10:03.769 --> 00:10:04.959
It's nothing.

00:10:05.109 --> 00:10:07.266
But, Franny, Just now...

00:10:07.673 --> 00:10:09.470
Mind your own business.

00:10:10.409 --> 00:10:11.569
Franny!

00:10:12.311 --> 00:10:14.604
I told you before...

00:10:14.754 --> 00:10:17.478
I hate people who talk too much!

00:10:18.684 --> 00:10:20.276
I am sorry!

00:10:22.688 --> 00:10:25.048
A tough girl like Franny shouldn't cry.

00:10:25.198 --> 00:10:26.556
I can't believe this.

00:10:26.726 --> 00:10:28.956
What happened?

00:10:56.055 --> 00:10:59.513
Here is the special ward
which Franny takes care of.

00:11:00.359 --> 00:11:02.691
What kind of patients are here,
I wonder?

00:11:03.763 --> 00:11:05.890
I am not your servant.

00:11:09.168 --> 00:11:10.999
I hate to take care of you.

00:11:25.351 --> 00:11:30.812
I failed to do my duty.
I'm not a good nurse!

00:11:33.259 --> 00:11:37.525
The patient from the special ward
treats her like a servant.

00:11:38.197 --> 00:11:42.361
Franny is the best student,
she can't bear that.

00:11:42.702 --> 00:11:45.034
That's why she cried last night.

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:56.878
Franny, how is the special ward?

00:11:58.084 --> 00:11:59.847
It's easy.

00:12:02.021 --> 00:12:05.388
The patient in the special ward
must be different from others.

00:12:06.692 --> 00:12:11.152
The rich people should be unreasonable,
shouldn't they?

00:12:11.597 --> 00:12:14.589
He is very kind.

00:12:14.934 --> 00:12:16.625
How nice.

00:12:16.775 --> 00:12:19.529
I too want to look after the patient
in the special ward.

00:12:19.679 --> 00:12:22.229
You can't.
You are not a top student.

00:12:22.379 --> 00:12:24.104
I'm leaving.

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:28.277
Franny, is he rich?

00:12:29.915 --> 00:12:34.511
It is said that
he has some land on the lakeside.

00:12:36.322 --> 00:12:38.445
And some villas too.

00:12:38.595 --> 00:12:40.218
That's great!

00:12:42.061 --> 00:12:46.498
Lakeside? Villa?
Same as the Adley family!

00:12:47.533 --> 00:12:51.629
An odd and wordy old man.

00:12:52.738 --> 00:12:53.726
Franny!

00:12:53.876 --> 00:12:58.242
- No, he is talkative.
- That's terrible.

00:12:58.577 --> 00:13:02.513
However, he is kind to me.

00:13:02.748 --> 00:13:05.911
Franny is truly
good at dealing with the patient.

00:13:07.553 --> 00:13:10.211
He asks everybody to
call him Grandfather William.

00:13:10.361 --> 00:13:11.755
William?

00:13:22.701 --> 00:13:25.261
Grandfather William of Adley family?

00:13:25.504 --> 00:13:27.335
He's here!

00:13:27.706 --> 00:13:30.641
I wanted to see him all the time.

00:13:34.914 --> 00:13:36.677
Franny!

00:13:38.584 --> 00:13:43.487
Please, Franny! Let me take care of him!

00:13:45.591 --> 00:13:48.560
I really want to look after him!

00:13:49.695 --> 00:13:50.992
Candy!

00:13:51.697 --> 00:13:55.189
- You are a new student.
- Unreasonable.

00:13:55.701 --> 00:13:58.101
Please, Franny!

00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:02.199
You are a new student.

00:14:02.349 --> 00:14:04.330
How can you look after the patient
in the special ward?

00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:07.934
I have to take care of him,
no matter how.

00:14:08.084 --> 00:14:10.607
Please! Let me look after him!

00:14:11.917 --> 00:14:15.683
Do you covet his money?

00:14:16.755 --> 00:14:17.915
No!

00:14:29.969 --> 00:14:31.197
Alright.

00:14:31.537 --> 00:14:34.734
Let's change our shifts tomorrow.

00:14:37.576 --> 00:14:38.665
Franny!

00:14:38.815 --> 00:14:41.171
You must do that carefully.

00:14:41.321 --> 00:14:42.503
Yes!

00:14:42.653 --> 00:14:44.616
You are full of confidence.

00:14:44.783 --> 00:14:47.343
I'll report to the headmistress.

00:14:47.686 --> 00:14:50.553
Thank you, Franny!

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:53.649
At last,
I can meet Grandfather William!

00:14:53.799 --> 00:14:56.518
The grandfather William
adopted me as his daughter.

00:14:56.668 --> 00:15:00.258
My dream finally came true!

00:15:06.572 --> 00:15:08.335
- Wait!
- Candy!

00:15:09.308 --> 00:15:11.139
How arrogant!

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:13.273
She won't make it.

00:15:13.712 --> 00:15:17.341
Leave it to her without authorization,
you might get trouble.

00:15:18.183 --> 00:15:22.607
Don't worry!
Master William won't like her.

00:15:22.757 --> 00:15:24.586
She will be finished soon.

00:15:28.627 --> 00:15:32.956
What?
Leave the special ward to her?

00:15:33.106 --> 00:15:35.926
Does the patient trouble you?

00:15:36.076 --> 00:15:38.828
No, it's Candy's idea.

00:15:38.978 --> 00:15:43.862
You are not that kind of person
who is willing to give up easily.

00:15:44.012 --> 00:15:46.672
No, I never give up.

00:15:47.646 --> 00:15:51.772
You are the only person
who can take care of that patient.

00:15:51.922 --> 00:15:53.642
Candy?

00:15:53.792 --> 00:15:55.578
You want to try her?

00:15:55.728 --> 00:15:56.882
Yes!

00:15:57.856 --> 00:16:00.182
Are you making fun of her?

00:16:00.332 --> 00:16:02.123
No!

00:16:02.461 --> 00:16:05.518
Franny, it's still your job.

00:16:05.668 --> 00:16:08.497
That dim-wit might mess things up.

00:16:09.368 --> 00:16:12.161
She'll need your help by then.

00:16:12.311 --> 00:16:13.704
Yes!

00:16:26.585 --> 00:16:29.611
The headmistress promised that?

00:16:30.556 --> 00:16:32.148
Thank you!

00:16:37.262 --> 00:16:40.129
What does Grandfather William look like?

00:16:42.201 --> 00:16:45.068
An affable face with a white beard?

00:16:45.671 --> 00:16:49.732
As serious as Aunt Elroy?

00:16:50.509 --> 00:16:54.240
Will he be surprised
when we meet each other?

00:16:55.981 --> 00:16:59.348
He would be surprised for sure
that I was here.

00:16:59.985 --> 00:17:03.352
I left the St. Paul academy
without telling him...

00:17:04.123 --> 00:17:06.387
Gosh!! I'm sure to be blamed.

00:17:07.726 --> 00:17:12.686
Grandfather,
I'll look after you as an apology.

00:17:12.998 --> 00:17:15.057
Please don't blame me.

00:17:15.501 --> 00:17:18.902
I can't wait to see you.

00:17:19.738 --> 00:17:22.901
The day
I became the daughter of Adley family...

00:17:23.208 --> 00:17:27.036
I was expecting to meet you gratefully.

00:17:27.186 --> 00:17:31.708
The days in Lakewood,
the life in London...

00:17:32.217 --> 00:17:35.118
It's you who gave me that.

00:17:35.654 --> 00:17:37.913
We are now so close to each other.

00:17:38.063 --> 00:17:42.392
You are now ill in the special ward.

00:17:42.828 --> 00:17:46.730
I would do everything for you!

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:04.140
No! I overslept!

00:18:04.550 --> 00:18:07.144
I was too happy to sleep last night.

00:18:07.586 --> 00:18:10.555
I didn't notice that
Franny was already up.

00:18:16.562 --> 00:18:19.258
Headmistress Merry Jane!

00:18:19.598 --> 00:18:22.931
Good morning, dim-wit!
It's your cap again.

00:18:24.203 --> 00:18:26.171
Good morning!

00:18:26.572 --> 00:18:28.797
Where is here, dim-wit?

00:18:28.947 --> 00:18:31.171
Sorry, it's corridor.

00:18:31.677 --> 00:18:33.902
So, it's not the street here...

00:18:34.052 --> 00:18:38.039
How can you look after the patient
like that?

00:18:38.917 --> 00:18:40.942
Headmistress!

00:18:42.621 --> 00:18:44.576
I will not be dim again.

00:18:44.726 --> 00:18:47.887
Let me look after Grandfather William.
Please!

00:18:48.327 --> 00:18:52.020
You should ready for that...

00:18:52.170 --> 00:18:54.356
you would do everything he asked.

00:18:54.506 --> 00:18:56.860
He is a patient anyway.

00:18:57.010 --> 00:18:57.901
Yes!

00:18:59.104 --> 00:19:02.628
Good, go to Doctor Frank.

00:19:02.778 --> 00:19:05.866
- He wants to talk to you.
- Yes, I'm going.

00:19:06.016 --> 00:19:08.970
Dim-wit, we're on the corridor!

00:19:14.419 --> 00:19:16.114
What a...

00:19:16.655 --> 00:19:19.414
The headmistress is an odd woman...

00:19:19.564 --> 00:19:22.289
so is Grandfather William too.

00:19:22.461 --> 00:19:26.227
I won't mind.
I'll do everything he asked.

00:19:26.732 --> 00:19:32.796
He must be a kind person
or he wouldn't adopt me as his daughter.

00:19:42.881 --> 00:19:44.348
Excuse me!

00:19:52.457 --> 00:19:54.581
I am doctor Frank.

00:19:54.731 --> 00:19:57.321
I am Candy, nice to meet you.

00:19:58.397 --> 00:20:02.424
This is the nurse's room,
the patient is in the next door.

00:20:06.071 --> 00:20:09.131
The special ward
is quite different from other...

00:20:09.775 --> 00:20:12.869
The patient needs rest. Be quiet!

00:20:13.312 --> 00:20:14.939
I am sorry!

00:20:15.581 --> 00:20:16.973
He's an odd guy...

00:20:17.123 --> 00:20:20.038
speak carefully and watch your attitude.

00:20:20.188 --> 00:20:22.552
Yes! I will, doctor.

00:20:23.589 --> 00:20:26.888
Please! Anyway.

00:20:32.798 --> 00:20:35.665
Grandfather is behind this door.

00:20:36.034 --> 00:20:37.797
Behind this door...

00:21:04.229 --> 00:21:06.094
Grandfather William!

00:21:06.932 --> 00:21:12.802
Under my taking care of,
you will be recovery soon enough.

00:21:15.641 --> 00:21:18.735
Candy's eyes are filled with tears.

00:21:19.478 --> 00:21:25.144
The sight is dimmer and dimmer
through her tears.
